flowchart LR
  classDef person fill:#E8F5E9,stroke:#2E7D32,color:#1B1B1B
  classDef system fill:#E6F2FB,stroke:#0078D4,stroke-width:2px,color:#1B1B1B
  classDef ext fill:#F3F2F1,stroke:#605E5C,stroke-dasharray:4 3,color:#1B1B1B

  subgraph Users["People (Microsoft Entra ID accounts)"]
    EMP["Employee<br/>submits & tracks own requests"]:::person
    APR["Manager / ItAdmin<br/>approve, fulfil, retry routing"]:::person
    ADM["AppAdmin / Auditor / SecurityReviewer<br/>administer types, read audit and access requests"]:::person
  end

  SS["SmartServe<br/>IT Service & Access Request Portal<br/>(React SPA + .NET 8 Web API)"]:::system

  ENTRA["Microsoft Entra ID<br/>«external» sign-in, app roles"]:::ext
  GRAPH["Microsoft Graph<br/>«external» manager lookup, sendMail"]:::ext
  AZ["Azure platform services<br/>App Service, Azure SQL, Key Vault,<br/>VNet + private endpoints, App Insights"]:::ext
  GH["GitHub<br/>repo, Actions, CodeQL, Issues/PRs"]:::ext
  SDLC["Agentic SDLC platform<br/>(scripts/sdlc + Copilot CLI)"]:::system

  EMP -->|HTTPS| SS
  APR -->|HTTPS| SS
  ADM -->|HTTPS| SS
  SS -->|OIDC sign-in / JWT validation| ENTRA
  SS -->|managed identity| GRAPH
  GRAPH -.->|e-mail| EMP
  SS -->|hosted on / uses| AZ
  GH -->|CI/CD deploys via OIDC| AZ
  SDLC -->|generates docs & code via PRs| GH
